      "name": "Well-Architected frameworks",
      "description": {
        "content": "The AWS Well-Architected Framework helps customers design secure, high-performing, resilient, and efficient  cloud infrastructure.  Plerion continuously assesses your environment against the AWS Well-Architected pillars,  aligning your architecture with AWS best practices and accelerating improvement.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
